    "proof": "Induction through (3n+1)/2^v gives the displayed affine numerator. Layer counts are invariant under permutation, whereas the powers of two in B(v) use ordered prefix sums. The cylinder congruence theorem realizes every positive valuation word as an odd residue class. Direct iteration of the two stated representatives proves the descent split.",
